  "ruleText": "Ph 601.17 Violations. Any person who distributes legend drugs according to RSA 318:51-b and the provisions of Ph 600, shall be subject to disciplinary action as provided in RSA 318:29.\n\nSource. #8572, eff 2-23-06, EXPIRED: 2-23-14\n\nNew. #12335, eff 7-22-17",
